id><description/></item><item><title>J. Ramírez</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/j.-ramirez/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/j.-ramirez/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tatiana Gelvez-Barrera</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/tatiana-gelvez-barrera/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/tatiana-gelvez-barrera/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gordon Wetzstein</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/gordon-wetzstein/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/gordon-wetzstein/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Hayato Ikoma</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/hayato-ikoma/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/hayato-ikoma/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Samuel Pinilla</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/samuel-pinilla/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/samuel-pinilla/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Yifan Peng</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/yifan-peng/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/yifan-peng/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Karen Sanchez</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/karen-sanchez/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Oct 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/karen-sanchez/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Sergio Castillo</title><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/sergio-castillo/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Oct 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/sergio-castillo/</guid><description/></item><item><title/><link>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/admin/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Feb 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jorgebaccauis.github.io/authors/admin/</guid><description>&lt;p>Jorge Bacca received the B.S. degree in Systems Engineering (&lt;em>cum laude&lt;/em>) and the Ph.D. degree in Computer Science (&lt;em>laureate thesis&lt;/em>) from the Universidad Industrial de Santander (UIS), Bucaramanga, Colombia, in 2017 and 2021, respectively.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>He is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Systems and Informatics at UIS and the Founder and Director of the &lt;a href="https://pigroupuis.github.io/pigroup-research/">Inverse Problems Research Group (PiGroup)&lt;/a> (in formation). He is also a Postdoctoral and Visiting Researcher at GIPSA-lab, Université Grenoble Alpes (France) within the &lt;em>PHAIMS&lt;/em> project, and a Consulting Associate Editor for the &lt;em>IEEE Open Journal of Signal Processing&lt;/em>. He has authored &lt;strong>28 JCR journal articles: 16 Q1 and 12 Q2&lt;/strong> and conference papers in computational imaging, inverse problems, and signal processing.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>His current research interests include inverse problems, computational imaging, modulo imaging, unlimited sampling, optimization, spectral imaging, and deep learning.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>